      "finding": "10/10 指标跨诊断显著 (Kruskal-Wallis), 7/10 Bonferroni 显著. gait_velocity PD 1.241 > MSA 0.901/PSP 0.913 (H=28.78); TUG 单调梯度 PD 9.32s < MSA 13.36s < PSP 15.68s (H=23.25). PD 最轻, PSP 双支撑时相最长. 报告: 07-quality/h01-report.md"
    },
    "H02_tug_clinical": {
      "status": "completed",
      "finding": "TUG×UPDRS rho=+0.588 (n=83, p<0.0001), TUG×HY rho=+0.506, TUG×PSPRS rho=+0.529 (n=20). 3/5 通过, UMSARS 不显著 (n=16 功效不足). 报告: 07-quality/h02-report.md"
    },
    "H03_wb_severity": {
      "status": "completed",
      "finding": "SUPPORTED (STRONG): 105 检验 Holm 后 36 显著, 28 强显著全符合方向. speed_max x PIGD rho=-0.648 (n=84), slength_max x PIGD -0.621, speed_max x UPDRS -0.570, speed_longWB x PIGD -0.560; 步数/MVPA/active-sed 与 UPDRS/HY 负相关 (rho -0.44~-0.53); HY 分层 speed_max H=16.26 p=0.0003 (HY3 0.971 < HY1/2 ~1.2). PSPRS/UMSARS (n=21) 无强显著 (功效不足, 同 H02 UMSARS). 报告: 07-quality/h03-report.md"
    },
    "H04_3class_auc": {
      "status": "completed",
      "finding": "MODERATE: 三分类 (PD 39/MSA 18/PSP 18, n=75) OvR macro AUC wb+age=0.632 (95%CI 0.599-0.664), wb_only=0.610, age_only=0.491 (机会) → WB 特征非年龄代理; PSP 最难分 (0.542-0.560); Top 特征 steps_count_total (p=3.3e-4)/speed_max (1.0e-3)/slength_longWB. 报告: 07-quality/h04-report.md"
    },
    "H04b_posture_3class": {
      "status": "SUPPORTED",
      "finding": "IGA_mean 姿势特征增强三分类: macro AUC 0.632->0.720 (+0.088), PSP 0.560->0.681 (+0.121); IGA_cv/IGA_asy 无增益. 姿势水平(非变异/非不对称)是 PSP 判别关键. 报告: 07-quality/h04bc-report.md"
    },
    "H04c_pd_vs_atypical": {
      "status": "SUPPORTED",
      "finding": "二分类 PD vs MSA+PSP: wb+age+IGA_mean AUC=0.736 (CI 0.706-0.766), +0.067 over wb+age. 日常步行+姿势 = 诊断判别双通道."
    }
